<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Fall as AI Jitters Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasury Yields Hit Two-Month Low as Risk-Off Move Accelerates&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>安大略省教师协会首席执行官表示“漫长”的人工智能建设会危及赌注</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ontario-teachers-ceo-says-very-long-ai-buildout-imperils-bets</link><description>安大略省教师养老金计划首席执行官乔·泰勒表示，人工智能的成功将取决于为该技术建设基础设施所需的时间。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ontario-teachers-ceo-says-very-long-ai-buildout-imperils-bets'&gt;安大略省教师协会首席执行官表示“漫长”的人工智能建设会危及赌注&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ontario Teachers’ CEO Says ‘Very Long’ AI Buildout Imperils Bets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/ontario-teachers-ceo-says-very-long-ai-buildout-imperils-bets</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:02:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Selloff Hits Unlikely Market, Sinking Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Aareal 银行为 SRT 风险最高的部分提供超过 12% 的溢价</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium</link><description>Aareal Bank AG 将向投资者支付超过 12% 的溢价，以对冲价值约 25 亿欧元（合 27 亿美元）的商业房地产贷款账簿的部分风险，这只是其第二笔此类交易。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium'&gt;Aareal 银行为 SRT 风险最高的部分提供超过 12% 的溢价&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Aareal Bank Offers Over 12% Premium on Riskiest Part of SRT&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:04:32 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>